      "writtenOn": "2023-12-07T10:35:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The token is part of the HVC ABI so is always `u64` (it\u0027s the contents of one of the CPU registers) but the physical address might not; if `#address-cells \u003d 1`, libfdt will (in the background) read one cell and our wrapper will bit-extend it into a `u64`.",
